@startuml environment_lighting_additions

package environment {
  class Lighting {
    -- Added Fields --
    - lastHasLantern: boolean = false
    - lastLanternRadius: int = -1
    - lastLanternIntensity: float = -1.0f

    -- Existing Fields (context) --
    - darknessFilter: BufferedImage
    - lastCenterX: int
    - lastCenterY: int
    - lastCircleSize: int
    - lastBrightness: float
    - lastWidth: int
    - lastHeight: int

    -- Added Methods --
    + updateAndMaybeRecreate(circleSize: int, brightness: float, hasLantern: boolean, lanternRadius: int, lanternIntensity: float): void
    - createFilter(circleSize: int, brightness: float, hasLantern: boolean, lanternRadius: int, lanternIntensity: float): void

    -- Existing Methods (context) --
    + Lighting(gameWindow: GameWindow, circleSize: int)
    + updateAndMaybeRecreate(circleSize: int, brightness: float): void
    + draw(g2: Graphics2D): void
  }
}

package window {
  class GameWindow {
    + getPlayer(): Player
    + getObj(): Entity[]
  }
}

package player {
  class Player {
    + getCurrentLight(): Entity
    + getWorldX(): int
    + getWorldY(): int
  }
}

package entity {
  class Entity {
    + isLightSource(): boolean
    + getLightRadius(): int
    + getLightIntensity(): float
  }
}

package frame {
  class FrameApp {
    + getScreenWidth(): int
    + getScreenHeight(): int
  }
}

environment.Lighting --> window.GameWindow : reads player position
environment.Lighting ..> frame.FrameApp : reads screen size
player.Player --> entity.Entity : currentLight (nullable)
environment.Lighting ..> java.awt.geom.Point2D : uses (for radial center)

note right of environment.Lighting
**Notes**
- 新しいキャッシュ用フィールドはランタンの有無とそのパラメータを追跡し、不要なフィルタ再生成を回避します。
- updateAndMaybeRecreate(...) はランタンパラメータを受け取り、関連する状態変化があれば createFilter(...) を呼び出します。
- createFilter(...) は暗転レイヤーを合成し、ランタン装備時には RadialGradientPaint と DstOut 合成を使ってソフトな光の穴を切り抜き、中心に小さな楕円をクリアして確実に視界を確保します。

- New cached state fields track last lantern presence and parameters to avoid unnecessary filter recreation.
- updateAndMaybeRecreate(...) now accepts lantern parameters and triggers createFilter(...) when relevant state changes.
- createFilter(...) composes a darkness layer and, when a lantern is present, uses a RadialGradientPaint and DstOut composite to carve a soft light hole; it also clears a small central ellipse for guaranteed visibility.
end note

@enduml